Third party components
----------------------
NimbusX downloads and runs, but does not redistribute as its own work:

  rclone 1.75.2 (MIT)                  https://github.com/rclone/rclone
  rclone-extra 1.75.2-extra (MIT)      https://github.com/gulp79/rclone-extra  (TeraBox backend, unofficial)
  WinFsp 2.1.25156 (GPLv3 with a FLOSS exception)   https://github.com/winfsp/winfsp

Each is fetched by scripts/fetch-deps.ps1 and verified against the SHA-256 pinned in
src/NimbusX.Mount/DependencyVersions.cs. Their licences are those of their own projects; a package that bundles
them must also ship their licence files, which the installer copies next to the binaries.
